{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"vendor":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"{{ product.vendor }}","text_style":"uppercase"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews-ugc\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","locale_option":"geolocation","locale_fallback":"","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Our immensely popular Mini Set in a <strong>colourful new look<\/strong>! We're celebrating <strong>ten years of O’Donnell Moonshine this year<\/strong> and we're making it pop in March. Get our favourite flavours in a <strong>limited edition design<\/strong> and raise a glass with us to a great decade of Moonshine and many more wonderful years to come!<\/p><p>This Mini Set also makes the <strong>perfect gift for the Easter season<\/strong>. With their bright colours (and a bit of imagination) you could even say they resemble Easter eggs! So, why not go for something a little different, and make this Easter one to remember!<\/p>","page":""}},"32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders under £40<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders £40-£70<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["vendor","title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","variant_picker","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","bffe66cd-99d4-43eb-acd0-9850f187e77f","description","collapsible-row-0","32b786d6-269a-4f91-b1c1-1127d452915e","306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128","collapsible-row-2"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"medium","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":fa